    old "Eager to get her clothes back on, Sarah quickly got dressed again."
    new "Ansiosa por recuperar su ropa, Sarah se vistió rápidamente de nuevo."

    old "Atilla walked back onto the training ground, still fully naked. Unlike humans, the orc seemed to experience no shame from his nudity."
    new "Atilla regresó al campo de entrenamiento, todavía completamente desnudo. A diferencia de los humanos, el orco no parecía sentir vergüenza alguna por su desnudez."

    old "He began pointing out weights and instruments."
    new "Comenzó a señalarle los pesos y los instrumentos."

    old "One by one he explained to Sarah what to use, how to use it, when to use it."
    new "Uno por uno, le explicó a Sarah qué usar, cómo usarlo y cuándo usarlo."

    old "He explained a strict routine of excercise and diet that she would have to obey to the letter."
    new "Le explicó una rutina estricta de ejercicio y dieta que ella tendría que seguir al pie de la letra."

    old "After he finished explaining her the routine, he pointed towards his belt and loincloth, still where he had left them."
    new "Después de terminar de explicarle la rutina, señaló hacia su cinturón y su taparrabos, donde todavía los había dejado."

    old "Fetch that for me."
    new "Tráeme eso."

    old "Sarah obeyed her new mentor."
    new "Sarah obedeció a su nuevo mentor."

    old "She picked up the belt and loincloth and tried handing them back to Atilla."
    new "Ella recogió el cinturón y el taparrabos e intentó devolvérselos a Atilla."

    old "He didn't not grab them."
    new "No es que no los cogiera."

    old "It's not going to put itself on..."
    new "No se va a poner solo..."

    old "She grabbed the belt by both ends and tried to loop it around the orc's waist."
    new "Agarró el cinturón por ambos extremos e intentó pasarlo por la cintura del orco."

    old "With his large size, Sarah could barely get her hands around his waists as she tried to fasten the belt back on him."
    new "Con su gran tamaño, Sarah apenas podía rodear su cintura con las manos mientras intentaba volver a abrocharle el cinturón."

    old "She pressed her face into his chest. It felt like steel."
    new "Apoyó el rostro contra su pecho. Era como el acero."

    old "Below, pressing against her stomach, she could feel his large member."
    new "Debajo, presionando contra su estómago, podía sentir su gran miembro."

    old "Finally, she managed to loop the belt and close the buckle, making the orc decent again. As decent as he was ever going to be."
    new "Finalmente, logró pasar el cinturón por el anillo y cerrar la hebilla, dejando al orco de nuevo decente. O al menos, tan decente como jamás podría llegar a estar."

    old "Atilla gave his belt a tug, pleased at her work."
    new "Atilla tiró de su cinturón, satisfecho con el trabajo de ella."

    old "He turned around and continued his lecture."
    new "Él se dio la vuelta y continuó su lección."

    old "Sarah studiously followed him and absorbed his lessons."
    new "Sarah lo seguía con atención y asimilaba sus lecciones."
